        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SD-GDP625005SBR, 5-3/4\" Bamboo Style Glass Shower Door Pulls</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis realistic looking Small Bamboo Shower Door Pull was molded from a real piece of bamboo. After perfecting the master molds, the craftsman at First Impressions cast each piece from solid brass. This 5-3/8 inch shower door pull set comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it back-to-back on a 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass shower door including 2 pulls and 2 sets of rosettes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GSP03-specifications.gif?v=1704354642\" width=\"384\" height=\"256\" border=\"0\" alt=\"First Impressions GDP03 Dimensions Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Longer <a href=\"/products/11-3-4-inch-bamboo-shower-door-pull-set-first-impressions-pr-sd-gdp6250011sbr\"><b>12 Inch Bamboo Shower Door Pulls</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the First Impressions SD-GDP625005SBR Guadalupe Shower Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2.13\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Mounting: 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass doors.</i>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-GDP03-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262233\"><b>First Impressions SD-GDP625005SBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This door pull is hand assembled in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Packaged with 2 door pulls, 4 decorative rosettes plus mounting hardware for back to back mounting on 1/4\" to 1/2\" thick glass shower doors.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Small Bamboo Shower Door Pulls",
                "description": "This realistic looking Small Bamboo Shower Door Pull was molded from a real piece of bamboo. After perfecting the master molds, the craftsman at First Impressions cast each piece from solid brass. This 5-3/8 inch shower door pull set comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it back-to-back on a 1/4 inch to 1/2 inch thick glass shower door including 2 pulls and 2 sets of rosettes.\r\n",
